   "text": "`plans`\n*«Repository»*\n**PlanRepository**\n+ plans: Collection<Plan>\n  // the catalog\n– – –\n+ list(): Plan[]\n  // the sellable plans\n+ load(id: string): Plan | null\n  // any plan in the collection; an unsellable plan (Promo) is never listed, but loads when its voucher unlocks it",
   "kind": "rect",
   "size": "small",
